FDRreg Psychiatric GWAS Pipeline
================================

Scope of this repository
------------------------

This repository contains the study-specific psychiatric genomics workflow,
including GWAS preparation, covariate selection, sample-overlap decorrelation,
pipeline orchestration, sensitivity analyses, enrichment, validation, and
reporting code used for the associated psychiatric-disorder study.

Upstream FDRreg ownership
-------------------------

The FDRreg statistical method and the third-party FDRreg R package were
developed and published by their original authors. They were not created by the
authors of this repository. The repository invokes FDRreg as an external
dependency; it does not transfer ownership of, or supersede the citation and
license requirements for, the upstream method or package.

Users should cite both:

1. The original FDRreg method/package, following its official documentation.
2. This psychiatric genomics workflow and its associated study, using
   CITATION.cff.

